      "content": "Wait, sorry, what's with the goblin stuff? I'm just trying to make a professional slide deck for my managers. Can you redo that without the forest/goblin metaphors? I just need the actual technical stages and the industry-standard gates for each one. \n\nAlso, you cut off at the end—can you finish the part about Staging and then add the Production Deployment stage?",
